-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
Number of observations            6,184   ->   4,506       
Number of variables                   5   ->   7           
j variable (2 values)              year   ->   (dropped)
xij variables:
                               workers_   ->   workers_2019 workers_2022
                                    va_   ->   va_2019 va_2022
                                output_   ->   output_2019 output_2022
-----------------------------------------------------------------------------

